      "google_reviews_json": "{\"place_id\":\"ChIJRSlA5Q3VwkcRU6iZWIM3-vA\",\"rating\":3.8,\"user_rating_count\":95,\"google_maps_uri\":\"https://maps.google.com/?cid=17364252350547077203\",\"fetched_at\":\"2026-11-12T20:02:17+01:00\",\"reviews\":[{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":2,\"text\":\"Une boulangerie idéale si vous n'avez pas besoin de pain ou de pâtisseries mais que vous voulez regarder des étagères vides\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-11-03T20:13:40+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a une semaine\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"San Antonio\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106624407406305553573/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUG8MjA-xGLcy8FgvwpIJRFNrc6nLzOB1WYhsg_dXe-msK8F94=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-29T18:06:09+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 2 semaines\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Adel Bouzekri\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112121355013369414746/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWM89X6NxaB705c8x4sLLTWiYR5VAXSVjPoNI_S5XCz-s12RnZqCw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-04T16:32:19+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a un mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"BRIGITTE Leroy\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112664833258396393907/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJHzWiPp93tjZguEAlgcPzkhRO3QUfps8hvNYcqKWBqfyS1IQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":1,\"text\":\"Très déçue, je suis venu hier dans cette boulangerie les baguettes.\\nHyper sèches , je retente une fois aujourd'hui je prends 2 petites quiches emballées dans un vulgaire plastique. C'est honteux au prix que ça coûte.plus jamais\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-09-10T10:40:24+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 2 mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Delphine mansuet\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116173500983745924932/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIag4sIb_7dTmcLC-0zEcbun5Wv0mj8C2O_CXPl6yb3EgCUgQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"La boulangerie-pâtisserie Delpierre offre un accueil chaleureux et souriant, ce qui est très appréciable. Les produits sont de grande qualité et la pâtisserie est tout simplement excellente, avec un très grand choix pour tous les goûts.\\nJe recommande tout particulièrement les pâtisseries au chocolat, un vrai régal ! 🍫😋 Une adresse que je recommande sans hésiter !\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-08-14T14:28:43+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 3 mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Jean François Bridelance\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111919348779110104391/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjULcBu4mWxThwD4POq1_B4gu-2Bhq7etjbqjOCa3sBt5tQAUi8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"}]}",
